0 !HELP 0 = upper arm vertical
0 !HELP -45 = lower arm horizontal
0 !HELP -90 = upper arm horizontal
0 !HELP -135 = lower arm vertical
0 !HELP Then rotate 9.782 about z axis to align with slope of torso

